    summary: "Report: Netanyahu calls on Trump to launch attack on Iran 'as soon as possible' Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu is urging Trump to carry out strikes on Iran \"as soon as possible\", according to Israel’s public broadcaster Kan. The report, published on Sunday, indicated that Trump has yet to make a decision on the matter is reluctant to do so.",
