    summary: "Trump claims he predicted drops in oil prices, stock market and hits from Iran after Democratic win in midterm elections US president Donald Trump claimed that he predicted a stock market decline as well as harsher attacks from Iran after the Democratic victory in the recent midterm elections. \"As everyone remembers, I predicted two things concerning the November 3rd Midterm Elections. One, that if the Democrats win, the Stock Markets would go down, substantially, which they have, and two, that the Islamic Republic of Iran... will grow more aggressive in their attacks, which has also occurred,\" he wrote in a post on his platform Truth Social. Trump added that Iran \"launched more drones and missiles in the last week than at any time for over a year,\" but claimed that the attacks have \"all been knocked down, and done no damage\". \"Iranian leaders consider the Democrats weak, ineffective, and Country destroying, but I won’t let that happen! Both the Dems and Iran fought like hell to keep the Oil price up as long as possible and, since the Election, the Oil price has dropped by a record level,\" the American president further claimed. Trump went onto describe the elections as \"very strange\". In another post, he questioned the drop in oil prices, saying: \"Isn’t it interesting that Oil prices have dropped precipitously after the Midterm Elections? I said that was going to happen. The whole thing is a Giant Hoax!\"",
